0..71 Comment "// A host interface written with no import of its module names no type."
72..74 Comment "//"
75..152 Comment "// Each host interface lives in a `std` module, and the ambient scope answers"
153..229 Comment "// it nowhere. A source that names one imports its module, as it imports any"
230..246 Comment "// other module."
247..249 Comment "//"
250..327 Comment "// The source writes `std.io.Console.Eff` in a row and `std.process.Exit.Eff`"
328..405 Comment "// at a scope without `import std.io;` or `import std.process;`. Each head is"
406..468 Comment "// refused where it is written, and its help names the import."
469..471 Comment "//"
472..487 Comment "// - see: #4523"
